{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8451e2bb540ce568","type":"text","text":"The Iron Grind (Weapons & Armor):\n There are no glowing swords here. This massive open-air forge specializes in utilitarian brutality: thick plate armor, heavy crossbows, and silver-plated steel meant for hunting the beasts in the Wicked Woods.\n\nHalfing woman named Higglebottom\n","x":-300,"y":-140,"width":545,"height":190},
		{"id":"98ce3c9c21f77782","type":"text","text":"Crooked Candle (Hidden): \nEven with the Sharrans watching, there is always a black market. Hidden in the muddy crawlspaces beneath the docks, smugglers trade in banned arcane components (bat guano, pearl dust, strange herbs) meant for the sorcerers hiding out in Kaer Morhen.\n\nHidden under water beneath the sea with the only line of access from the sewers. \n\nThis place functions as a bar, inn, business hub and black market.\n\nEstablished by Glant Cilindrath the last remaining Cilindrath and head of the Watchers. Run by his wife Yelrien a Dhampir woman who practices black magic and aids sorceresses/mages in finding Kaer Morhen\n\nElvish woman Xintera\n\nRing of Protection: 4000gp","x":-335,"y":360,"width":615,"height":427},
		{"id":"cb92027149490cab","type":"text","text":"The Trapper's Bounty (Survival Gear): \nA vital stop for anyone heading inland. They sell massive bear traps, cold iron chains, blessed (but non-magical) Sharran chalk for warding campsites, and heavy lanters needed for traveling through the dense canopy of the Whipping Winds.\n\nRun by a man named Conrad a Human ex bounty hunter who is secretly friends with Yelrien\n","x":-340,"y":92,"width":620,"height":220},
		{"id":"02ad1cc2f8a50ef5","type":"text","text":"The Transient’s Rest (Tavern/Inn): \nSince there are barely any homes, this is a massive, multi-story, overcrowded longhouse where everyone sleeps. It is deafeningly loud. The food is purely survival-focused salted pork, hardtack, and thick, boiling fish stews served in hollowed-out wooden bowls.\n\nRun by a Human Woman and man named Zieth and Sarah\n","x":280,"y":-147,"width":614,"height":205},
		{"id":"8ebfbf46a2929fa6","type":"text","text":"Salt & Suture (Apothecary):\n A grim, poorly lit tent. They do not sell potions of healing. They sell herbal poultices, leeches, bandages, and bone-saws. If a player asks for a magical cure, the shopkeeper will likely threaten to call the Hounds.\n\nRun by a Sharren Cultist named Sharanla (elf)\n","x":300,"y":92,"width":694,"height":171},
		{"id":"24fd4f2423aa899e","x":-300,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[WildPort.canvas]]\n#WildFort"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}